 * companion), kept ONLY for struct sched_ext_ops / struct scx_exit_info
 * field-name provenance used to hand-write vmlinux_min.h in
 * ../scx-simple/. Not a complete or buildable file — see ANALYSIS.md.
 * Full file: https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/v6.12/kernel/sched/ext.c
 */

